config SYNTH_USB_IMPORT
	bool "Song import over USB WebSerial (USB CDC port)"
	depends on SYNTH_PROJECT_STORE
	default y
	help
		Adds a USB CDC (serial) interface alongside the USB audio stream:
		plug the board into any computer, open tools/usb_import.html in a
		browser (WebSerial over a secure context), and paste or upload an
		AMYSONG text file - or a .mid, converted on the device with the
		same converter the WiFi page uses - into a project slot. Runs on
		the CDC pump task; the actual song apply runs on the sequencer's
		single-applier ui task, identical to the WiFi importer.